 static boolean visibleText(AccessibilityNodeInfo node,String expected,int depth,int[] count){if(node==null||depth>18||count[0]++>=350)return false;try{if(node.isVisibleToUser()){CharSequence text=node.getText(),description=node.getContentDescription();if((text!=null&&text.toString().contains(expected))||(description!=null&&description.toString().contains(expected)))return true;}for(int i=0;i<node.getChildCount();i++)if(visibleText(node.getChild(i),expected,depth+1,count))return true;}catch(RuntimeException ignored){}return false;}
 void automationFailed(String reason,int id){if(!running||generation!=id)return;if(floating!=null)floating.reveal();pauseGoal(reason+"\n"+I18n.text(this,"error_paused"));}
 void cancelAutomation(String reason){if(sandbox!=null){SandboxClient old=sandbox;sandbox=null;old.cancel();try{remember(new JSONObject().put("type","tool_result").put("tool","run_code").put("status","cancelled").put("error",reason));}catch(JSONException ignored){}}if(macro!=null){MacroExecution old=macro;macro=null;remember(old.cancel(reason));}if(floating!=null)floating.reveal();}
